    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Wurrband",
    "summary": "[PSYCHIC] attacks made by friendly ORKS PSYKER models get +1 S, plus another +1 S per 5 models in the model's unit (or embarked within that model). Such models also have two psychic abilities, each of psychic level 1.\nRoar of Mork: in your Movement phase, provided this unit isn't battle-shocked, you may roll one D6 as a psychic roll for it. If you do, it becomes battle-shocked on a 1, and whatever the result you pick one enemy unit within 12\" of it that is not a MONSTER or VEHICLE; that unit takes a battle-shock roll at −1 per 10 models this unit contains.\nVisions of Violence: as any Fight phase begins, provided this unit isn't battle-shocked, you may roll one D6 as a psychic roll for it. If you do, it becomes battle-shocked on a 1, and whatever the result it has Fights First for the rest of that phase.",
